{"title":"Orc Triumph","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Orc Triumph is a named <a href=\"#/monster/orc\">Orc</a> seen at level 15–16.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Orc Triumph</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>Orc Lair</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 5×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-1000045904\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"orc-triumph\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><p class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for Orc Triumph yet.</p>\n      <h2>Other named Orcs</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/orc-guard\">Orc Guard</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/orc-wizard\">Orc Wizard</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/the-yokemaster\">The Yokemaster</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/varruk-the-raider\">Varruk the Raider</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/orc-jailer\">Orc Jailer</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/orc-champion\">Orc Champion</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/437e64fc8b90222ab1bd.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Orc Triumph</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/orc\">Orc</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>15–16</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>50</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>5 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}